  "prefLabel": "Plc 503.01 Providers Already Approved",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 503.01 Providers Already Approved. The following organization shall be deemed to be an approved provider under this chapter:\n\n(a) The New Hampshire Professionals’ Health Program, http://www.nhphp.org/, a New Hampshire-incorporated non-profit corporation.\n\nSource. #13971, eff 7-1-24",
